          %h2#captions_in_tables Captions in Tables
          %p
            Giving table captions example. A caption property can be plain text (!Caption) where the characters “&lt;” and “&gt;” can appear but wind up being escaped, or XML (!XMLCaption) where those brackets if they appear are assumed to delimit XHTML entities such as
            = succeed "." do
